atin\">Latin</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\"><a href=\"/wiki/canem#Latin\" title=\"canem\">canem</a></i>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Noun_2\">Noun</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"roa-poi\">chén</strong></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/dog\" title=\"dog\">dog</a></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"citation-whole\"><span class=\"cited-source\">Piveteau, Vianney (<span class=\"None\" lang=\"und\">1996</span>), <cite>Dicopoitevin</cite>&#8206;<sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://dicopoitevin.free.fr/index.php\">[1]</a></sup> (in French)</span></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Romagnol\">Romagnol</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romagnol_phonology\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Romagnol phonology\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">/ˈcɛn/</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Noun_3\">Noun</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"rgn\">chén</strong>&#160;<span class=\"gender\"><abbr title=\"masculine gender\">m</abbr>&#160;<abbr title=\"plural number\">pl</abbr></span></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#plural_number\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">plural</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"rgn\"><a href=\"/wiki/c%C3%A0n#Romagnol\" title=\"càn\">càn</a></i></span></span></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Noun_4\">Noun</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"rgn\">chén</strong>&#160;<span class=\"gender\"><abbr title=\"feminine gender\">f</abbr>&#160;<abbr title=\"plural number\">pl</abbr></span></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#plural_number\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">plural</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"rgn\"><a href=\"/wiki/c%C3%A2na#Romagnol\" title=\"câna\">câna</a></i></span></span></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vietnamese\">Vietnamese</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology_2\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"explain\" title=\"A nativized loanword, or a borrowing before Middle Chinese, or a borrowing from dialectal Chinese\">Non-<a href=\"/wiki/Sino-Vietnamese\" title=\"Sino-Vietnamese\">Sino-Vietnamese</a> reading</span> of <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Chinese language\">Chinese</a></span> <i class=\"Hant mention\" lang=\"zh\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9B%9E#Chinese\" title=\"盞\">盞</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">small cup</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span>, <span class=\"ann-pos\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sino-Vietnamese\" title=\"Sino-Vietnamese\">SV</a>: <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=tr%E1%BA%A3n&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"trản (page does not exist)\">trản</a></i></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation_2\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanoi\" class=\"extiw\" ti